      "title": "Multipass Estimate",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Multipass Estimate predicts render passes from a plate with trained models: MoGe-2 for metric depth, position and normals (plus AO and curvature computed from them), Marigold IID for albedo, roughness, metallic and diffuse/specular lighting.\n\nFirst run downloads about 4.9 GB (switch off download_missing_models to stop it). Turn off geometry, materials or lighting to skip a model.\n\nWrite EXR Passes saves every pass as layers of one multilayer EXR. Relight lights the estimated albedo with a point light placed in camera space (metres)."
